  questionType: 2
  questionText: Type the keyword that comes before the list of new values.
  code: 'Table: clues

    +----+----------+--------+

    | id | item     | room  
    |

    +----+----------+--------+

    |  1 | Backpack | Hall   |

    |  2 |
    Note     | Office |

    |  3 | Map      | Hall   |

    +----+----------+--------+


    INSERT
    INTO clues (item, room)

    ____ (''Flashlight'', ''Garage'');'
